            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Shelley D"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These were incredible!! Ever since going to Outback and having the mashed sweet potatos that taste almost like a dessert, I've wanted to re-create them at home. This was every bit as good!! I doubled the vanilla, and added a little extra sugar because I had more than 3 cups of sweet potatoes. My kids had 3 helpings!!! The crunchy toasted coconut topping was simply wonderful.",
            "datePublished": "2009-02-02T16:20:15.040Z"
          },
          {
