            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Red in Keds"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Served this at Thanksgiving and it was the new family favorite. I didn't have any coconut, so substituted finely chopped walnuts because it is what I had on hand. I personally would have liked it to be not quite so sweet, but I was alone on that !",
            "datePublished": "2011-01-16T07:32:27.500Z"
